bscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":4021283,"digest":"sha256:2335f5d3b4cafdf57a357bad27e8df80eea0279803ac8d089a0d8a32c5336fde","download_count":11,"created_at":"2026-09-29T00:08:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T00:08:00Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/releases/download/sdk/v0.28.0/foxglove_data_loader-v0.28.0-cpp-wasm32-unknown-unknown.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/tarball/sdk/v0.28.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/zipball/sdk/v0.28.0","body":"## What's Changed\r\n\r\n### Remote Access\r\n* Automatically apply Draco compression to ROS 1 `sensor_msgs/PointCloud2` channels (https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1481)\r\n* Expose Draco's sequential encoding method as an option (`DracoMethod`). It preserves point order at the cost of larger payloads (https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1472, https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1468)\r\n* Fix an issue where a gateway could stay connected to a room indefinitely after the last viewer disconnected (https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1453)\r\n\r\n### Schemas\r\n* Add `g711-alaw` and `g711-ulaw` formats to `foxglove.RawAudio` (https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1455)\r\n* Add G.726 format identifiers (`g726-{16,24,32,40}`, `aal2-g726-{16,24,32,40}`) to `foxglove.CompressedAudio` (https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1457, https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1456)\r\n\r\n### Other\r\n* python: Fix `foxglove.Channel` ignoring `metadata` when `context` was also provided (https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1454)\r\n* breaking: python: Update Layout API from v0.50.0 to v0.59.0. `TreeScopedFrameId` is removed, so `frame_id`, `follow_tf` and `fixed_frame` accept only `str`. New options include plot series `id`, `array_expansion` and `line_interpolation`; 3D map `altitude_mode` and `reference_measurement`; `projection_distance`; `enable_transform_sync`; and `location_fix_frame` (https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1441, https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1444, https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1448, https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1452, https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1471, https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1475, https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/pull/1485)\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/foxglove/foxglove-sdk/compare/sdk/v0.27.0...sdk/v0.28.0"}